<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57586" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισσός</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιττός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ivy, Hedera
			Helix</i>, of three kinds, two <i>climbing</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλας</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκός</span>), and one <i>creeping</i> (also called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλιξ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Bacch.</u>
				40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτενής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					826
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισσοῦ στέφανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGl</u>
					49.7
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); sacred to Dionysus, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισσῷ . . στεφανωθεὶς Διόνυσον
					θεραπεύει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλῳ δὲ περί σε κ. εὐπέταλος ἕλικι
					θάλλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					999
				</span></i>
			: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνωψ</span> (or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνωπός</span>) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				674
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιρσός</span>
			 (<span class="entity">Achaean</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
